function Client:create_cross_account_authorization(input) end

---Creates a readiness check in an account. A readiness check monitors a resource set in your application, such as a set of Amazon Aurora instances, that Application Recovery Controller is auditing recovery readiness for. The audits run once every minute on every resource that's associated with a readiness check.
---
---`POST /readinesschecks`
---Errors: AccessDeniedException, ConflictException, InternalServerException, ThrottlingException, ValidationException.
---@param input aws.route53_recovery_readiness.CreateReadinessCheckRequest
---@return aws.route53_recovery_readiness.CreateReadinessCheckResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_readiness_check(input) end

